            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A stand (10) for a laser projection device is provided. The stand (10) includes a mounting structure that couples to the laser projection device (28). In one embodiment the stand (10) includes three legs (12) that are coupled together at a junction, and a central column (16) extends downward from the junction and the mounting structure is coupled to the mounting structure, thereby permitting the laser projection device (28) to emit light towards a ground.</p>
